<Guide
  title="Oregon QSBS: The 2026 Tax Change and What Comes Next"
  description="Oregon now adds back federal QSBS exclusions for 2026 and later tax years. Understand SB 1507, its dates, residency, and the proposed 2027 follow-up."
  heading="Oregon QSBS: the 2026 change and the 2027 policy debate"
